ue suit with jacket and pointy shoe and two little strap for keeping pants up. Think maybe Grunk see suit like that before some place, but not remember for sure. Gnome dragging trunk behind him, too. Gnome walk over to Grunk. Give trunk to Grunk. Think that means carrying it Grunk job now. "It was a good idea to call for help," gnome say. "It certainly made finding you easier." Gnome start walking toward tunnel that Grunk not try yet. Him look back and say, "Well, c'mon. I'll show you the way out." Gnome go southeast. Probably New Tunnel This really tricky place. It all twisty and dark. Think even pig confused. Gnome here, waiting for Grunk. "I've decided it's time to quit being a hermit," gnome say. "I suppose in some way, you're responsible for that. I want you to know, you've really impressed me. I've seen plenty of visitors come and go, but you're one of the very few who actually cared enough to put everything back the way you found it." Gnome stop and think. Grunk think gnome thinking about what way to go. Then gnome look back at Grunk and say, "So, thanks." Gnome climb down into hole in ground. [Grunk score go up one.] Some Other Cave There still lots of different tunnel here that go every way Grunk can see. Not really know where Grunk at, but Grunk think gnome know, and that good enough for Grunk. Gnome here, waiting for Grunk. Gnome say to Grunk, "It's been too long since I've done anything that really mattered. But I've got some new ideas, and I think they could be big. Bigger than mossfuressence, even." Gnome look left and right. "Come on, we're going this way," him say. Then him duck into little tunnel that go south. Walking around in tunnel seem so easy for gnome. Him even talking at same time and still not get lost at all. Forest Hey, Grunk outside again! Yay! It still night time, but Grunk have light, so that OK. This look like it near place Grunk at before. Farm not far at all from here. Just little way to southwest. Gnome here, waiting for Grunk. Gno